Dialogue: 0,0:00.30,0:03.50,cap,,40,40,100,,What is the most expensive material
Dialogue: 0,0:03.50,0:05.79,cap,,40,40,100,,in the entire universe?
Dialogue: 0,0:05.79,0:08.00,cap,,40,40,100,,Worth trillions?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08.00,0:12.00,cap,,40,40,100,,I'm sure you've never heard of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12.00,0:15.50,cap,,40,40,100,,Listen to these three facts!
Dialogue: 0,0:15.50,0:17.50,cap,,40,40,100,,Fact one:
Dialogue: 0,0:17.50,0:22.50,cap,,40,40,100,,One gram costs over 60 trillion dollars!
Dialogue: 0,0:22.50,0:26.00,cap,,40,40,100,,Far pricier than any diamond!
Dialogue: 0,0:26.00,0:28.00,cap,,40,40,100,,Fact two:
Dialogue: 0,0:28.00,0:31.00,cap,,40,40,100,,All humanity's antimatter
Dialogue: 0,0:31.00,0:34.00,cap,,40,40,100,,would not fill a teaspoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:34.00,0:36.00,cap,,40,40,100,,Fact three:
Dialogue: 0,0:36.00,0:40.00,cap,,40,40,100,,They annihilate in a flash of pure energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:40.00,0:43.50,cap,,40,40,100,,You are goodness and light from God...
Dialogue: 0,0:43.50,0:45.00,cap,,40,40,100,,Tell me in the comments:
Dialogue: 0,0:45.00,0:48.00,cap,,40,40,100,,Will humanity ever harness it?
Dialogue: 0,0:48.00,0:49.00,cap,,40,40,100,,Follow Dawsha!
